":"被奏削封者","evidence":["wuwen-q-30de9653d5114fdc5d0a"]},{"person":"wuwen-p-031a65927b653f","role":"奏中被述作物者","evidence":["wuwen-q-30de9653d5114fdc5d0a"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["wuwen-q-30de9653d5114fdc5d0a"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuwen-q-30de9653d5114fdc5d0a","order":3881}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0281","name":"曹据","evidence":["wudi-q-p093","shaodi-q-p022","wuwen-q-d026b75bb69455e575a6","wuwen-q-c39d98e02bdca1a6606d","wuwen-q-3952eef25726d47de870","wuwen-q-4a4bdeb9f6696c26f9ea","wuwen-q-c8f6967536a94cf95656","wuwen-q-4fedb3924804cdd4cbf9","wuwen-q-b73ef183f80de085efbf","wuwen-q-ff4dff6de98238620283","wuwen-q-f28ae307ff59c783d262","wuwen-q-30de9653d5114fdc5d0a","wuwen-q-e7b0c9c20a9cf2bc73e7","wuwen-q-fb760ba31f5d4c24c7f1","wuwen-q-c2f55f326342aebf012b"],"facts":[{"id":"wuwen-f-e481dcdc835e724d3871","text":"父为曹操；本传记母为环夫人。","evidence":["wuwen-q-c2f55f326342aebf012b"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-p093-wudi-p0281","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-p093"]},{"id":"shaodi-m-p022-wudi-p0281","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["shaodi-q-p022"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-q-p022","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-d30a83ecef7e92642fb2","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《魏略》曰：“景王将废帝，遣郭芝入白太后。太后与帝对坐，芝谓帝曰：‘大将军欲废陛下，立彭城王据。’帝乃起去。太后不悦。芝曰：‘太后有子不能教，今大将军意已成，又勒兵于外以备非常。但当顺旨，将复何言！’太后曰：‘我欲见大将军！口有所说。’芝曰：‘何可见邪？但当速取玺绶！’太后意折，乃遣傍侍御取玺绶，著坐侧。芝出报景王，景王甚欢。又遣使者授齐王印绶，当出就西宫。帝受命，遂载王车；与太后别，垂涕。始从太极殿南出，群臣送者数十人。太尉司马孚悲不自胜，余多流涕。王出后，景王又使使者请玺绶。太后曰：‘彭城王，我之季叔也。今来立，我当何之！且明皇帝当绝嗣乎？吾以为高贵乡公者，文皇帝之长孙，明皇帝之弟子。于礼，小宗有后大宗之义，其详议之。’景王乃更召群臣，以皇太后令示之；乃定迎高贵乡公。是时太常已发二日，待玺绶于温。事定，又请玺绶。太后令曰：‘我见高贵乡公，小时识之；明日我自欲以玺绶手授之。’”","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":304,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aad7486801fbf98d7830","start":0,"end":398,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p093a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-45a0a903628e24350a2b","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏书》曰：“庚辰，天子报：减户五千；分所让三县万五千，封三子，植为平原侯，据为范阳侯，豹为饶阳侯，食邑各五千户。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":63,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c2dadedcc9e5681ffbaf","start":0,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十六年：建安十六年（公元 211）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-889c5acff5776ef2f54b","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o128","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-37e542ccc37d1632e170","layer":"original","quote":"十六年春正月〖1〗，﹝一﹞天子命公世子丕为五官中郎将〖2〗，置官属〖3〗；为丞相副。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":42,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p093","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-45a0a903628e24350a2b","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏书》曰：“庚辰，天子报：减户五千；分所让三县万五千，封三子，植为平原侯，据为范阳侯，豹为饶阳侯，食邑各五千户。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":63,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c2dadedcc9e5681ffbaf","start":0,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-30de9653d5114fdc5d0a","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-0d194bc26897a8d0634c","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏书》载玺书曰：“制诏彭城王：有司奏，王遣司马董和，赍珠玉，来到京师中尚方，多作禁物，交通工官，出入近署，逾侈非度；慢令违制，绳王以法。朕用怃然，不宁于心。王以懿亲之重，处藩辅之位；典籍日陈于前，勤诵不辍于侧；加雅素奉修，恭肃敬慎；务在蹈道，孜孜不衰：岂忘率意正身，考终厥行哉？若然小疵，或谬于细人；忽不觉悟，以斯为失耳。《书》云：‘惟圣罔念作狂，惟狂克念作圣。’古人垂诰，乃至于此；故君子思心，无斯须远道焉。常虑所以累德者而去之，则德明矣；开心所以为塞者而通之，则心夷矣；慎行所以为尤者而修之，则行全矣：三者，王之所能备也。今诏有司宥王，削县二，千户；以彰八柄与夺之法。昔羲、文作《易》，著休复之诰；仲尼论行，既过能改。王其改行，茂昭斯义，率意无怠。”","attribution":"裴注·魏书","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":49,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1a9c5eeed81ee2d105b2","start":0,"end":331,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-3952eef25726d47de870","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-5c99121457238f8fb051","layer":"original","quote":"文帝以南方下湿，又以环太妃彭城人，徙封彭城。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":28,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-4a4bdeb9f6696c26f9ea","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-5c99121457238f8fb051","layer":"original","quote":"又徙封济阴。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":50,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-4fedb3924804cdd4cbf9","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-79a4bef270216bd1ddd2","layer":"original","quote":"太和六年，改封诸王，皆以郡为国〖5〗；据，复封彭城。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-b73ef183f80de085efbf","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-79a4bef270216bd1ddd2","layer":"original","quote":"景初元年，据坐私遣人诣中尚方作禁物，削县二，千户。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-c2f55f326342aebf012b","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-87027621c423a4f13bd6","layer":"original","quote":"武皇帝二十五男：卞皇后生文皇帝、任城威王彰、陈思王植、萧怀王熊；刘夫人生丰愍王昂、相殇王铄；环夫人生邓哀王冲、彭城王据、燕王宇；杜夫人生沛穆王林、中山恭王衮；秦夫人生济阳怀王玹、陈留恭王峻；尹夫人生范阳闵王矩；王昭仪生赵王幹；孙姬生临邑殇公子上、楚王彪、刚殇公子勤；李姬生谷城殇公子乘、郿戴公子整、灵殇公子京；周姬生樊安公均；刘姬生广宗殇公子棘；宋姬生东平灵王徽；赵姬生乐陵王茂。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":190,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-c39d98e02bdca1a6606d","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-5c99121457238f8fb051","layer":"original","quote":"三年〖2〗，为章陵王；其年徙封义阳。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":10,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-c8f6967536a94cf95656","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-5c99121457238f8fb051","layer":"original","quote":"五年〖3〗，诏曰：“先王建国，随时而制。汉祖增秦所置郡；至光武以天下损耗，并省郡县。以今比之，益不及焉；其改封诸王，皆为县王〖4〗。”据，改封定陶县。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":56,"end":131,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-d026b75bb69455e575a6","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-5c99121457238f8fb051","layer":"original","quote":"黄初二年，进爵为公。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":10,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-e7b0c9c20a9cf2bc73e7","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-f5af11f8443a0156c5a0","layer":"original","quote":"彭城王据，建安十六年，封范阳侯。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-f28ae307ff59c783d262","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-79a4bef270216bd1ddd2","layer":"original","quote":"正元、景元中，累增邑；并前四千六百户。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":66,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-fb760ba31f5d4c24c7f1","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-f5af11f8443a0156c5a0","layer":"original","quote":"二十二年〖1〗，徙封宛侯。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":29,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-ff4dff6de98238620283","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-79a4bef270216bd1ddd2","layer":"original","quote":"﹝一﹞三年〖6〗，复所削户邑。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":51,"end":66,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
